  "version": "0.20.0-alpha.6",
  "notes": "## 0.20.0-alpha.6 - 2026-08-01\n\n### Features\n\n- Add per-device controls for choosing which content types this computer can send to and receive from each paired device (#1461)\n- Make removing devices from older spaces secure, with protection and readmission status shown on the Devices page (#1457)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Paste file paths from Quick Panel without changing the system clipboard (#1476)\n- Preserve the original names of received files stored in the managed cache (#1475)\n- Restore live progress updates for file transfers (#1453)\n\n<!-- zh -->\n\n## 0.20.0-alpha.6 - 2026-08-01\n\n### Features\n\n- 新增按设备控制收发内容类型的功能，可分别设置本机向每台已配对设备发送和接收哪些内容 (#1461)\n- 支持从旧版空间中安全移除设备，并在设备页面显示保护和重新接纳状态 (#1457)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- 修复从快捷面板粘贴文件路径时会改变系统剪贴板的问题 (#1476)\n- 修复接收至受管缓存的文件未保留原始名称的问题 (#1475)\n- 修复文件传输的实时进度不再更新的问题 (#1453)",
